# panel-card-orange 128x80. W10-C T2 cutscene panel (Class F
# card): the ARC COMPLETE card for arc orange. Original
# in-house art, generated deterministically by w10c-rig/
# gen-panels-t2.mjs. Brief = the arc record: "Amber League —
# WINNER." / "Four island badges and a champion's battle under
# southern stars. The Winner's Trophy is yours — and so is the
# strange ball that started the voyage." A night shore: the
# Trophy on its plinth (four badge glints = the recorded four
# island badges) and the Sealed Orb apart on the sand, seam
# unbroken, under the southern stars.
PIX panel-card-orange 128 80
